            "type": "reasoning_text",
            "text": "The user asks in Chinese: \"用一句话说明快速排序的平均复杂度,并简单解释为什么。\" - \"Explain in one sentence the average complexity of quicksort, and briefly explain why.\"\n\nI should answer in Chinese. The request asks for one sentence stating the average complexity and a brief explanation. Let me provide a concise answer.\n\nQuicksort average time complexity: O(n log n).\n\nWhy: On average, the pivot divides the array into roughly equal halves (balanced partitions), so the recursion depth is O(log n), and each level does O(n) work in partitioning, giving O(n log n) total.\n\nKeep it brief as requested. The format should be short - one sentence plus brief explanation. Maybe the complexity statement and then the explanation. Since they ask \"一句话说明...并简单解释为什么\", I can give the sentence with the complexity, then the explanation. Keep it concise."
